#: docs/haptic-protocol.rst:136
msgid "In Silkie"
msgstr "Silkie 中的实现"

#: docs/haptic-protocol.rst:138
msgid ""
"Silkie plays the taps on the trackpad on macOS, with the generic tap standing in for ``click`` "
"and ``complete``, and the user turns them off with :opt:`haptic_feedback`. It has no way to drive"
" a pen or a dial on any system it runs on, so ``caps`` is ``1`` on macOS and ``0`` elsewhere, and"
" requests for the other targets, ``start`` and ``stop`` are accepted and do nothing."
msgstr ""
"Silkie 在 macOS 触控板上播放轻触，用通用轻触代替 ``click`` 和 ``complete``；用户可通过 :opt:`haptic_feedback` 关闭。Silkie "
"在其运行的各系统上都无法驱动笔或旋钮，因此 macOS 的 ``caps`` 为 ``1``，其他系统为 ``0``；针对其他目标的请求及 ``start``、``stop`` "
"会被接受，但不产生效果。"

